### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Get HTML movie list (Default route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Get all movies
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies

### Get movies with filters
### Filter by year
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?year=2010

### Filter by director
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?director=Nolan

### Filter by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?title=Matrix

### Combined filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?year=2010&director=Christopher Nolan

### Get specific movie by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/67452ff492ba56efba37b8a5

### Create a new movie (valid data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Interstellar",
    "director": "Christopher Nolan",
    "year": 2014
}

### Create a new movie (invalid data - missing fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Interstellar",
    "year": 2014
}

### Create a new movie (invalid year)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Future Movie",
    "director": "John Doe",
    "year": 2025
}

### Update existing movie
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/67454e198a33e08c86d09899
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Inception - Director's Cut",
    "director": "Christopher Nolan",
    "year": 2010
}

### Update non-existent movie
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Non-existent Movie",
    "director": "Unknown Director",
    "year": 2020
}

### Delete existing movie
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/6745485194507e6e585f0a21

### Delete non-existent movie
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/999

### Test undefined route
GET {{baseUrl}}/undefined-route

### Complex filtering scenarios
### Multiple partial matches
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?director=Chris

### Case insensitive search
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?title=matrix

### Year range (if implemented)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?year=2010&director=nolan